{"schema":"hsr-localizations.v1","entryId":"other-message-p7469","chapterId":"s896f6f06f9231bef","language":"ja","referenceCommit":"74a7b96fba32f00cf495a5c00b0311bd02207aaf","rows":[{"id":"other-message-p7469-45f2b57949295d887338","text":"[開拓者]、ヤバいことになったよ","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-918dcd5a1bb2c80aa050","text":"やっぱりそう簡単にはいかないか","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-5d1bf88b472dbfea3b7a","text":"当てて{F#あげよっか}{M#やろうか}。また何か「サプライズ」が起きたん{F#でしょ}{M#だろ}？","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-c659d4e3160abeaac127","text":"ウチと虚照さん、囲まれちゃった","speaker":""},{"id":"other-message-p7469-365aad10989664268d7b","text":"千星シティの治安部隊に、治安を乱したって言われて捕まりそうなの","speaker":""}]}
